ew test methods (58 lines added) — covers all scenarios: happy path, idempotency, state conflict, and not found\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are addressed, all tests pass, no forbidden files were changed, and all error cases are properly tested.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED (idempotently), rejects CANCELLED with 409, and rejects non-existent with 404.\nChanged       ApiError.kt: Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code for state conflict scenarios\n              ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm() endpoint implementing state transitions and error handling  \n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 4 tests covering happy path, idempotency, cancelled rejection, and not-found cases\nTests         `confirms a created shipment and transitions it to confirmed` — validates CREATED→CONFIRMED transition\n              `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds and changes nothing` — validates idempotent retry safety\n              `rejecting a cancelled shipment with HTTP 409` — validates conflict response for invalid state\n              `rejecting confirm on a non-existent shipment with HTTP 404` — validates not-found response\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests run (5 original + 4 new + 8 others), 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped\nNot done      (nothing; all acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests pass, no forbidden files modified)\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3323,"cache_read_input_tokens":22331,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3323},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":nu